## v0.1.5 — 2026-04-19

**Summary:** Clarify five design ambiguities: HOST_ECOSYSTEM_UNKNOWN error semantics, --active-set-max CLI flag, watch entry point and process lifecycle, ledger write semantics and prune conditions, and update_history format.

**Rationale:** Code review identified these gaps: HOST_ECOSYSTEM_UNKNOWN lacked user-facing recovery guidance; --active-set-max had no CLI surface; watch process lifecycle (startup, shutdown, concurrency) was unspecified; ledger note/change_log write semantics and prune triggers were undefined; update_history allowed multiple serialization formats creating append inconsistency risk.

**Spec refs:** Data and Interface Contracts, Runtime Flows, Ownership or Source of Truth, Deletion and retention semantics

**Checklist ids:** discovery-and-parse, watch-and-hooks, state-and-reporting, overlap-and-active-set

